  "bio": "Rod Maz is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Buenos Aires City, Argentina, specializing in illustrative styles. He is known for his high level of respect for his clients, as indicated in his mantra, \"Respect Above ALL.\" Also, he seems to be an integral member of the ProTeam at Emalla. Rod Maz brings magic to his work, as seen in his unique \"Callisattva\" and \"Calligraffiti\" designs, driven by a deep dedication to his craft.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Buenos Aires City, Buenos Aires Autonomous City, Argentina\n\n✦ @callisattva 𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑹𝒀𝑷𝑻𝑬𝑫 𝑮𝑬𝑴𝑺 ✦ \n👇👇👇👇 • Mexico City 🇲🇽\n📆MÉXICO AGENDA: MARZO => ABRIL\n📨 AGENDA: LINKS DE MI BIO, NO DMs porfa\n•I tattoo and paint•\n\n✦ @callisattva 𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑹𝒀𝑷𝑻𝑬𝑫 𝑮𝑬𝑴𝑺 ✦ \n👇👇👇👇 • Mexico City 🇲🇽\n📆MÉXICO AGENDA: MARZO => ABRIL\n📨 AGENDA: LINKS DE MI BIO, NO DMs porfa\n•I tattoo and paint•",
